OL,3,GNEWSAOperator paid more than #10m to
OL,4,Akeep parking free at Edinburgh hospital
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than #10m has been paid to the
OL,7,Fprivate operator of the Royal Infirmary
OL,8,Fof Edinburgh (RIE) to keep parking at
OL,9,Fthe hospital free, new figures show.
OL,11,FParking charges ended at most of
OL,12,FScotland's hospitals in 2008 but
OL,13,Fremained in place at three facilities
OL,14,Fwhich were part of Private Finance
OL,15,FInitiative (PFI) contracts.
OL,17,FDeals worth #35m to buy out the car
OL,18,Fparks at Ninewells Hospital in Dundee
OL,19,Fand Glasgow Royal Infirmary were
OL,20,Fannounced in 2021 and SNP ministers
OL,21,Fsaid they would keep the RIE free until
OL,22,Fa deal was in place there.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
