OL,3,GNEWSAOperator paid more than #10m to
OL,4,Akeep parking free at Edinburgh hospital
OL,5,
OL,6,FNew figures show PFI operator Consort
OL,7,Fwill have been paid more than #12m to
OL,8,Fkeep parking free at the RIE by the
OL,9,Ftime its deal to run the facility ends
OL,10,Fnext year.
